WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,260
Your battery is less than 10%

2
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:16,690
I'm asking about the end of the world

3
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:18,690
He's checking the battery

4
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:31,410
A power bank

5
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,410
Change your Miao Dao

6
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,410
Replace or not

7
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:39,890
So you were waiting for me here

8
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,890
Thieves will never die

9
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:44,660
The price of a power bank

10
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,660
Not so high

11
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:55,890
Haven't you already given up on him?

12
00:00:55,890 --> 00:01:00,160
I left without looking back.

13
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,160
I thought he really gave up

14
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:04,160
I even praised him for being decisive.
